    {
      "id": "paper-adarsi",
      "type": "Paper",
      "title": "AdaRSI: Adaptive On-Demand Recursive Self-Improvement for Embodied Agents",
      "label": "AdaRSI: Adaptive On-Demand Recursive Self-Improvement for Embodied Agents",
      "team": "Northeastern University / AgiBot et al.",
      "date": "2026-10-20",
      "coreIdea": "失败时先改 harness（工具、提示、检索）再归因，按需触发权重微调；可预算的 Agentic + RSI 工程框架。",
      "paperUrl": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20474",
      "projectUrl": null,
      "topics": [
        "topic-rsi",
        "topic-agentic"
      ],
      "relatedPapers": [],
      "papers": [],
      "description": null,
      "body": "物理世界 RSI 的关键不是「能不能改自己」，而是「先改谁、何时值得改权重」。AdaRSI 把 harness 级修复放在前面，权重更新变成按预算触发的最后手段。",
      "sourceFile": "content/papers/adarsi.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-fast-vla",
      "type": "Paper",
      "title": "Fast-VLA: One-Shot Task Understanding with Lightweight Closed-Loop Actors",
      "label": "Fast-VLA: One-Shot Task Understanding with Lightweight Closed-Loop Actors",
      "team": "Huawei",
      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "coreIdea": "任务理解只跑一次大 VLM，之后由轻量 actor 闭环执行，显著降低在线推理成本。",
      "paperUrl": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.21389",
      "projectUrl": "https://garfield-kh.github.io/FastVLA",
      "topics": [
        "topic-vla"
      ],
      "relatedPapers": [],
      "papers": [],
      "description": null,
      "body": "端到端大 VLA 每步都跑完整多模态栈，控制频率与功耗很难同时满足。Fast-VLA 把「理解」与「伺服」解耦：语义一次到位，闭环留给轻量策略。",
      "sourceFile": "content/papers/fast-vla.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-haf-vla",
      "type": "Paper",
      "title": "HAF-VLA: Hierarchical Action Flow for Humanoid Vision-Language-Action",
      "label": "HAF-VLA: Hierarchical Action Flow for Humanoid Vision-Language-Action",
      "team": "Peking University / Beijing Humanoid Robot Innovation Center et al.",
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "coreIdea": "在 π₀.₅ 上引入分层 action flow（腿头 → 腰 → 臂手），把全身运动学结构显式写入 VLA 动作生成。",
      "paperUrl": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.26584",
      "projectUrl": null,
      "topics": [
        "topic-vla",
        "topic-wbc"
      ],
      "relatedPapers": [],
      "papers": [],
      "description": null,
      "body": "人形全身控制若仍把动作当成扁平向量，基座与腰姿错误会逼迫上身补偿。HAF-VLA 用分层流式生成，让下身与腰先定姿态语义，再生成臂手精细动作。",
      "sourceFile": "content/papers/haf-vla.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-pact-vla",
      "type": "Paper",
      "title": "PACT-VLA: Delay-Robust Vision-Language-Action via Predictive Asynchronous Chunk Selection",
      "label": "PACT-VLA: Delay-Robust Vision-Language-Action via Predictive Asynchronous Chunk Selection",
      "team": "HKUST(GZ) et al.",
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "coreIdea": "把异步推理延迟当作决策窗口，在提交前用更新观测选择最优 action chunk，提升 VLA 真机落地的延迟鲁棒性。",
      "paperUrl": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.28019",
      "projectUrl": null,
      "topics": [
        "topic-vla",
        "topic-agentic"
      ],
      "relatedPapers": [],
      "papers": [],
      "description": null,
      "body": "异步推理场景下，模型输出滞后于环境变化。PACT-VLA 的核心不是再压低单次推理时延，而是承认延迟不可避免，并把这段「等待窗口」变成可利用的信息：用更新后的观测在提交前重选 / 校正 chunk。",
      "sourceFile": "content/papers/pact-vla.md"
    },
    {
